-- #182 (owner-approved 2026-10-22 after lane R3's research): delete the 412 empty child pools - Outland/Kalimdor ore node positions
-- whose gameobject spawns were removed long ago (pool ids track a guid sequence; each empty child sits on a guid gap) in the
-- alexkulya DB lineage. A max-1 'Master pool' that rolls an empty child spawns nothing and never re-rolls until restart,
-- so ore slots died out during uptime (~135 of 239 at boot). No source (alexkulya 2021/2023, SkyFire 548, MoPCore,
-- TC 4.3.4, AC) has their member rows. Both tables are cleaned (a pool_template left behind would log as an isolated empty pool).
-- Backup: the PM takes a SHA256-verified mysqldump of world.pool_pool + world.pool_template before applying.
-- Undo: restore pool_pool / pool_template from that dump (the deleted ids are the list below).
